<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"What are you all doing in a place like this!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"M-</STYLE>Mom<STYLE ID="1">, what're you doing in </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s secret base, then...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Just then, another set of footsteps came echoing in.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Oh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had come.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Aww, my secret base..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s very own secret space had a whole crowd come into it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">You have my sympathies...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Everyone, get off the maaat! I'm going to open that up."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"O-open it...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
Obasan<STYLE ID="3"> opened the toolbox she'd been carrying and took out a screwdriver.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Mom<STYLE ID="1">, what's under here!? This is a really suspicious place, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> says!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Ehhh? Is that sooo?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Come to think of it, I hadn't told </STYLE>Obasan<STYLE ID="3"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> about the vision I'd seen at the convenience store.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I should tell these two as well.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"―I see... So it was here that <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> got splashed with blood..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... So that's how </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> came to have a witch's power..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I'll take that <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE> out right nooow! The tools for the memorial service are kept down here. 
{PAUSE ""}
Really, only women recognized as witches are allowed in, but... will you help me?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Is that okay!? For us to go in...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If it's even a little clue toward solving this, you're welcooome! It's dark, so be caaareful!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">A storage place for ritual implements―it didn't seem to be as suspicious a place as I'd thought.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But that </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It's all connecting after all...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">All the bolts were removed, and the thick hemp cloth was moved aside.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地グレーチング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Under the hemp cloth was a 1-meter-square grating (a metal drain grid).</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was covering a hole that led down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">With this, no wonder the water never </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="た">pooled</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, however much it rained.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And hemp cloth would dry relatively quickly, too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, you didn't notice this was here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm... I didn't notice... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I thought I heard water, but I figured it was a mountain stream or groundwater."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The hemp cloth was as thick as a carpet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The grating's mesh was fine too, so just lying on it, you wouldn't notice.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\グレーチング開ける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Obasan<STYLE ID="3"> shifted the grating with a crowbar, opening the door to the underground.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地穴.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">A </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="さ">rusted</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> ladder was fixed there, leading down into pitch-black darkness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I listened closely, I could faintly hear the sound of flowing water.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I'll go down first, okaaay! Once the light down there is on, be careful coming dooown!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハシゴ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Obasan<STYLE ID="3"> slowly climbed down the </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="さ">rusty</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> ladder.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I'm a little scared..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Your danger sense?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No, it's just... a feeling... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Like there's some unknown monster down there..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's fine. Seems like people go in and out all the time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I know, but..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">―Before long, a faint light appeared from below.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Obasan<STYLE ID="3"> seemed to have turned on the light down there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Was it about 5 meters deep?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, I'll go down first. After that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you come. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what about you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmmm! Of course I'm going! I'm gonna uncover everything about my secret base!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"I'm going too. I want to see everything there is to see."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... I'll wait here. I have to pull the ritual implements up with a rope."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> aside, the rest of us were to go down.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハシゴ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "10000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ugh... this ladder's covered in </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="さび">rust</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> slowly climbed down the ladder.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, go ahead!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">She seemed to have made it down safely.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ハシゴ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The 5-meter ladder was taller than I'd imagined.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ハシゴ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "15000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">I slowly climbed down the gritty, unpleasant ladder.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="さ">Rusted</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> as it was, it seemed firmly fixed to the wall and felt steady.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even so, I made my way toward the underground space without looking down.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Haah, that was scary..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">My hands were covered in </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="さび">rust</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and my clothes had gotten a little dirty too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\洞窟内川.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "4000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">The underground space seemed less like something dug out and more like a storeroom that made use of a cave that was already there, but there were some traces of digging by human hands.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A drainage channel had been dug in the corner, and water trickled along it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">This channel probably carried the rain that fell in from above somewhere else.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Oil lamps were mounted on the walls.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Rather than an underground </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="・">room</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, an underground </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="・">passage</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> might be the right way to describe it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The space went on far into the back.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Mom<STYLE ID="1">, what's back there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I've been told not to go too far baaack. There was a cave-in decades ago, and it's supposedly dangerouuus!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A cave-in...? In an underground passage like this, I suppose that could happen...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Whoa! Amazing!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Hey, hey, </STYLE>Auntie<STYLE ID="2">! Can I make this my secret base too!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Today's the only special daaay! When you turn 20, <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>, and get to be a witch, you can come iiin!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Tsk..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">At some point, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had come down too.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Come to think of it, on the way here there was a rock </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="ひさし">overhang</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> you could shelter from the rain under. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Maybe the ground here is easily eroded by water. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">So the rock is relatively soft, and it was probably easy to dig, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">But why would anyone dig in a place like this...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">For something that formed naturally, it feels awfully neat..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was looking all around the underground space.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Today we're using thiiis!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\壺を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\壺と三脚.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">This is...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">No doubt about it. It was the </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and tripod from that vision...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But they gave a slightly different impression...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If I remember right...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\壺幻影.gal" "NORMAL" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had been set on the tripod and heated over a fire.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shirozaki-san had said it was used like offering incense, so at the memorial service it was probably heated over a fire the same way.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> lowered a rope from above, and the </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> tied to it was hauled up to the surface.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Um, may I look around here a little more?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hmm... As long as you don't go too far back, that's fiiine!
{PAUSE ""}
　There's supposedly a door made of iron bars, so don't go past it, okaaay!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Thank you. Let's go."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Somehow I </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="ちゅうちょ">hesitated</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> to go any further in, but I couldn't stop here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> in the lead, I went on into the depths of the cave with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">We went on, relying on our phone lights.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The cave was longer than I'd imagined.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Drainage channels ran along both sides of the passage the whole way, and only the quiet flow of water and our footsteps echoed.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\滝1.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "洞窟の滝.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Whoa, amazing...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Beside the passage was a large space, and in it, a waterfall roaring loudly.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Hmm, how strange..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's up?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Where does this much water go in the end?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　I don't think there was any river that big around here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"C'mon, let's go. That's not a big deal right now, is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―How far had we gone?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"So these are the iron bars."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="さ">Rusted</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and crumbling, the iron bars weren't a fixed barrier. They had a door in them, made of the same bars.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> grabbed hold of the door, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "3" "3" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\8_gacyagacya.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">and shook it hard back and forth.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"It's locked. If the lock were open, it looks like the door would move fine, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, don't shake it so much. Cave-ins happen easily down here, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Around the door, </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="くも">spider</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">webs were packed thick.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But they had almost no stickiness left, and broke easily when pulled.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Whatever had spun these webs was probably no longer alive, either.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">That's strange..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Strange?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Not strange, exactly... more like something feels off... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">I'm not sure, but something's bugging me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">Hm? What's that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> pointed past the iron bars.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Which one?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"More to the left. Can't you see something brown?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I strained my eyes...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下4.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Something like a brown snake was clinging to the rock wall.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"There are snakes even in a place like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"It's not a snake. </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="はちゅうるい">Reptiles</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> couldn't survive in a place like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then is there an opening somewhere a snake could get through?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Maybe so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> pressed herself against the bars.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That wiggly thing?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　That's a tree root, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> can actually see in the dark like this? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A root broke through rock like this and is sticking out?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"It must have broken through the rock over a long time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">And a tree that big would have to be..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Probably the cherry tree at the Niimura main house. It'd be right about above us here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I was amazed at the vitality of plants, that a cherry tree's roots could break through rock and stretch out like this.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">that was all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">All we'd done was observe nature. There was nothing that looked like a clue.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Surely the curse-killings couldn't be connected all the way down here, but...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下3.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you done?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Hold on, I'll take a picture just in case."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下4.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> stretched her hand through the bars as far as it would go and took a picture of the root.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Is something like this going to be any help?</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
